{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "願", "id": "願"}, {"form": "體", "id": "體"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.990719731730447, "source": "智", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 1.892107443062337, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.4866423349541726, "source": "智", "target": "夫子"}, {"weight": 1.892107443062337, "source": "智", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 1.1189175548288552, "source": "智", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.585254623622282, "source": "智", "target": "聖人"}, {"weight": 0.4257703742689099, "source": "智", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.892107443062337, "source": "智", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 0.15750638767423067, "source": "智", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.990719731730447, "source": "智", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 2.585254623622282, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.7379567632350787, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.096080247388273, "source": "聖人", "target": "體"}, {"weight": 1.629743178594846, "source": "聖人", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.808398174936492, "source": "願", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 0.7824453182076423, "source": "知", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.629743178594846, "source": "知", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.9365959980349006, "source": "知", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 2.4029330668283277, "source":